WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.596
FACING SOME BACKLASH AFTER A NEW

00:00:02.597 --> 00:00:04.937
GRASSROOTS PUSH TO GET MORE

00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:06.480
AMERICANS VACCINATED.

00:00:06.481 --> 00:00:08.300
THIS COMES AFTER THE MORE

00:00:08.334 --> 00:00:09.252
CONTAGIOUS DELTA VARIANT HAS

00:00:09.287 --> 00:00:10.071
SPREAD THROUGHOUT THE

00:00:10.105 --> 00:00:10.593
UNITED STATES.

00:00:10.628 --> 00:00:12.749
&gt;&gt; President Biden: WE NEED TO

00:00:12.783 --> 00:00:14.082
GO FROM COMMUNITY TO COMMUNITY

00:00:14.116 --> 00:00:15.249
AND KNOCK ON DOORS TO GET HELP

00:00:15.283 --> 00:00:18.566
TO PEOPLE AND PROTECT THEM FROM

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.168
THE VIRUS.

00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:22.639
&gt;&gt; Dana: AUTHOR OF THE BOOK

00:00:22.673 --> 00:00:23.628
"PANIC ATTACKS."

00:00:23.629 --> 00:00:26.109
WHEN I HEARD THAT, I THOUGHT HE

00:00:26.144 --> 00:00:27.831
IS TRYING TO GIVE IT A SHOT TO

00:00:27.865 --> 00:00:30.644
GET PEOPLE MORE INFORMATION.

00:00:30.678 --> 00:00:32.016
WHY THE BACKLASH?

00:00:32.018 --> 00:00:34.086
&gt;&gt; THE PRESIDENT FOUND HIMSELF

00:00:34.088 --> 00:00:36.318
IN A BIT OF A DICHOTOMY DURING

00:00:36.319 --> 00:00:37.194
THAT SPEECH.

00:00:37.196 --> 00:00:38.872
HE WAS DECLARING INDEPENDENCE

00:00:38.873 --> 00:00:41.130
FROM THE VIRUS, AND HE IS RIGHT.

00:00:41.131 --> 00:00:42.566
AMERICANS HAVE THE OPPORTUNITY

00:00:42.568 --> 00:00:44.367
TO CHOOSE TO BE VACCINATED TO

00:00:44.401 --> 00:00:45.975
PROTECT THEMSELVES AND THEIR

00:00:45.976 --> 00:00:47.265
LOVED ONES, BUT DECLARING THAT

00:00:47.266 --> 00:00:49.120
INDEPENDENCE DOESN’T MEAN THE

00:00:49.155 --> 00:00:50.606
PANDEMIC IS OVER.

00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:53.138
ALL OF A SUDDEN, HE SAYS WE ARE

00:00:53.139 --> 00:00:54.801
GOING TO SEND IT LOW LEVEL

00:00:54.835 --> 00:00:55.683
GOVERNMENT WORKERS TO YOUR

00:00:55.684 --> 00:00:56.135
HOUSE.

00:00:56.136 --> 00:00:58.071
WHILE SOME PEOPLE MAY SEE THIS

00:00:58.106 --> 00:00:59.544
AS A PUBLIC EDUCATION PAGE,

00:00:59.578 --> 00:01:01.991
WHICH IS ALWAYS A GOOD THING,

00:01:01.992 --> 00:01:03.328
THE MORE EDUCATION THE BETTER,

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:04.725
OTHERS MAY SEE THIS AS

00:01:04.727 --> 00:01:05.013
CONFRONTATIONAL.

00:01:05.015 --> 00:01:07.914
I CAN TELL YOU THAT IS NOT HOW

00:01:07.916 --> 00:01:09.631
YOU ARE GOING TO REACH THAT

00:01:09.632 --> 00:01:10.345
VACCINE HAS ATTENDED POPULATION.

00:01:10.379 --> 00:01:11.776
THEY ARE GOING TO ALREADY FEEL

00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:14.627
THAT YOU ARE INVADING THEIR

00:01:14.628 --> 00:01:15.548
SPACE.

00:01:15.549 --> 00:01:19.824
&gt;&gt; Dana: DR. NICOLE, LISTEN TO

00:01:19.826 --> 00:01:20.267
THIS.

00:01:20.268 --> 00:01:21.992
"HOW ABOUT IT DON’T KNOCK ON MY

00:01:21.993 --> 00:01:22.347
DOOR.

00:01:22.382 --> 00:01:24.208
YOU ARE NOT MY PARENTS.

00:01:24.242 --> 00:01:25.706
YOU ARE THE GOVERNMENT.

00:01:25.707 --> 00:01:29.743
WHY IS THAT CONCEPT SO HARD FOR

00:01:29.777 --> 00:01:30.505
THE LEFT?"

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:32.644
IN "THE WASHINGTON POST," IT

00:01:32.679 --> 00:01:35.234
ALSO SAID IN MARYLAND 100 PEOPLE

00:01:35.268 --> 00:01:36.894
DIED OF COVID ENGINE.

00:01:36.928 --> 00:01:38.093
100% OF THEM WERE UNVACCINATED.

00:01:38.094 --> 00:01:39.498
THAT WAS ONE OF THE THINGS THAT

00:01:39.533 --> 00:01:42.736
THE PRESIDENT WAS TRYING TO SAY

00:01:42.737 --> 00:01:44.338
YESTERDAY, I SUPPOSE.

00:01:44.339 --> 00:01:46.273
&gt;&gt; THAT IS NOT JUST MARYLAND.

00:01:46.275 --> 00:01:47.536
THAT IS MANY STATES ACROSS THE

00:01:47.537 --> 00:01:48.372
COUNTRY.

00:01:48.406 --> 00:01:50.939
THE DEBTS THAT ARE STILL

00:01:50.974 --> 00:01:53.065
OCCURRING TEND TO BE THOSE THAT

00:01:53.066 --> 00:01:53.805
ARE UNVACCINATED.

00:01:53.806 --> 00:01:56.139
THE BEST WAY TO PROTECT PEOPLE

00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:57.131
IS TO GET VACCINATED.

00:01:57.133 --> 00:01:58.241
AGAIN, THIS IS FREEDOM OF

00:01:58.243 --> 00:01:58.744
CHOICE.

00:01:58.746 --> 00:02:00.836
THAT IS WHAT IS VERY IMPORTANT.

00:02:00.837 --> 00:02:02.253
IT GOES TO THE CORE OF OUR

00:02:02.287 --> 00:02:02.879
COUNTRY.

00:02:02.881 --> 00:02:05.972
WHEN YOU TURN ON OTHER MEDIA

00:02:05.974 --> 00:02:08.522
OUTLETS, YOU HEAR PEOPLE CALLING

00:02:08.557 --> 00:02:10.253
FOR REQUIRING THEM AND MANDATES.

00:02:10.254 --> 00:02:11.368
YOU CAN’T DECLARE INDEPENDENCE

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:12.367
AND THE FREEDOM TO CHOOSE

00:02:12.369 --> 00:02:15.133
VACCINATION, AND THEN REQUIRE

00:02:15.134 --> 00:02:16.776
THEM AS WELL.

00:02:16.778 --> 00:02:18.116
THESE ARE CONVERSATIONS THAT

00:02:18.149 --> 00:02:20.489
NEED TO BE HAD BETWEEN

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:21.790
PHYSICIANS AND PATIENTS, AND NOT

00:02:21.824 --> 00:02:24.312
BY LOW-LEVEL PEOPLE PEOPLE

00:02:24.314 --> 00:02:26.180
KNOCKING ON DOORS.

00:02:26.215 --> 00:02:27.824
&gt;&gt; Dana: IT HAS BEEN BUILDING,

00:02:27.825 --> 00:02:29.981
BUT A LOT OF THE HEADLINES ARE

00:02:30.015 --> 00:02:32.665
TARGETED AND BLAMING ANYONE WHO

00:02:32.666 --> 00:02:34.441
VOTED FOR TRUMP OR THE RED

00:02:34.442 --> 00:02:34.670
STATES.

00:02:34.704 --> 00:02:35.840
THEY ARE THE ONES THAT ARE THE

00:02:35.874 --> 00:02:36.303
PROBLEM.

00:02:36.304 --> 00:02:38.232
A LOT OF THOSE PLACES ARE

00:02:38.233 --> 00:02:38.622
BRUTAL.

00:02:38.657 --> 00:02:40.783
SOME OF THEM DON’T HAVE THAT

00:02:40.817 --> 00:02:43.180
FANCY FREEZERS THAT CAN TAKE THE

00:02:43.181 --> 00:02:44.315
PFIZER OR MATURING OF VACCINES.

00:02:44.349 --> 00:02:47.950
HOW WOULD YOU PERSUADE SOMEONE

00:02:47.951 --> 00:02:49.526
TO GET THE VACCINE?

00:02:49.527 --> 00:02:51.222
&gt;&gt; THERE IS A LOT OF POLITICIZED

00:02:51.223 --> 00:02:53.594
NATION THROUGHOUT THE ENTIRE

00:02:53.628 --> 00:02:55.427
COURSE OF THE VACCINATION, BUT

00:02:55.462 --> 00:02:57.578
THE BEST THING THAT THE CDC AND

00:02:57.612 --> 00:02:59.155
THE ADMINISTRATION COULD DO IS

00:02:59.156 --> 00:03:00.941
TO REACH OUT TO THOSE HESITANCE.

00:03:00.942 --> 00:03:02.232
THAT HAS TO DO WITH GETTING FULL

00:03:02.234 --> 00:03:03.053
FDA APPROVAL.

00:03:03.055 --> 00:03:04.553
I THINK IT WILL HELP PEOPLE

00:03:04.588 --> 00:03:07.530
TRUST THE SAFETY MORE IF THEY

00:03:07.532 --> 00:03:09.148
GET THAT FULL APPROVAL.

00:03:09.182 --> 00:03:11.071
THEY NEED TO BE TRANSPARENT.

00:03:11.072 --> 00:03:12.567
THEY CAN’T BE SO MYOPIC WHEN IT

00:03:12.568 --> 00:03:13.387
COMES TO THE ADOLESCENT

00:03:13.388 --> 00:03:14.865
RECOMMENDATIONS, ESPECIALLY AS

00:03:14.867 --> 00:03:17.896
WE SEE RISING CASES OF

00:03:17.897 --> 00:03:18.755
MYOCARDITIS.

00:03:18.756 --> 00:03:21.447
THEY ARE CONTINUING TO NEGLECT

00:03:21.481 --> 00:03:22.919
NATURAL IMMUNITY, AND THEY

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:24.911
CONTINUE TO RECOMMEND PHIL DOES

00:03:24.945 --> 00:03:26.543
FOR ADOLESCENTS REGARDLESS OF

00:03:26.544 --> 00:03:27.902
RISK AND REGARDLESS OF PRESENCE

00:03:27.903 --> 00:03:28.968
OF NATURAL IMMUNITY.

00:03:28.969 --> 00:03:30.889
IF THEY DID THAT, I THINK THEY

00:03:30.891 --> 00:03:31.963
WOULD GAIN THE TRUST OF AMERICAN

00:03:31.997 --> 00:03:33.091
PEOPLE MORE.

00:03:33.125 --> 00:03:34.994
THIS HAS NOTHING TO DO WITH

00:03:34.995 --> 00:03:35.488
TRUST.

00:03:35.489 --> 00:03:37.320
YOU HAVE TO MAKE SURE IT IS

00:03:37.354 --> 00:03:38.292
AVAILABLE TO THE RURAL

00:03:38.326 --> 00:03:39.748
POPULATION, AND YOU HAVE TO MAKE

00:03:39.783 --> 00:03:40.634
SURE THAT THEY HAVE THE

00:03:40.668 --> 00:03:41.005
EDUCATION.

00:03:41.006 --> 00:03:43.637
THE WAY TO DO THAT IS TO REACH

00:03:43.638 --> 00:03:44.526
OUT TO LOCAL PUBLIC HEALTH

